; the one real UP-Term drawer as UPTREAL: (a multi-directory UP-Term: writes to its first directory only); the caller drops it
Assign >NIL: UPTREAL: UP-Term:
If EXISTS ENVARC:up-term/Dir
  Set uptdir "`Type ENVARC:up-term/Dir`"
  If NOT "$uptdir" EQ ""
    If EXISTS "$uptdir"
      Assign >NIL: UPTREAL: "$uptdir"
    EndIf
  EndIf
EndIf
